    description: "PR-2 of the inherited_calls campaign (parent META INV-nilud). Create `packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/inherited_calls.py` (substrate + Site-1 resolver + `_walk_insertion_order` walker). Add `included_modules` metadata extraction to `ruby.py` (class-decl pass) so `include`/`extend` declarations are visible to `inheritance.py`. Extend `inheritance.py` to emit `includes` edges (new `edge_type=\"includes\"`, `evidence_type=\"ast_includes\"`) when `included_modules` is populated and the target resolves to a project Symbol. Delete `_find_inherited_initialize` from `ruby.py` (`ruby.py:1901-1956`). Migrate `TestRubyConstructorEdges` (`test_ruby.py:3949-4163`) to pipeline-mode.\n\n**WI-puluf closes when this PR merges.** The `included_modules` extraction + `includes` edge type are exactly the substrate WI-puluf called for.\n\n**Edge types:** `calls` with `ast_call_inherited` (0.90 confidence) for Site 1; new `includes` edge type for Ruby mixins.\n\n**New ADR:** `docs/adr/00NN-cross-language-inherited-call-linker.md` documenting the contract + per-language MRO table.\n\n**Schema bump:** `docs/schema.json` registers `includes` edge type (heavyweight axis per ADR-0023).\n\n**Linker registration:** `priority=18` (between `inheritance`=15 and `type_hierarchy`=20). `LinkerActivation(always=True)`. `LinkerRequirement(name=\"unresolved_edges_with_hints\")`.\n\n**Bakeoff cohort:** chatwoot (Ruby mixin coverage), hypergumbo-self (Python regression check), spring-petclinic (Java canary — must be unchanged this PR).\n\n**Success criterion:** `ast_call_inherited` edges on chatwoot ≥ baseline; new `includes` edges present on chatwoot's `app/models/concerns/`, `app/controllers/concerns/`, and Sidekiq/ActiveModel/Devise sites; Java edge set on spring-petclinic byte-identical.\n\n**Tag at merge:** `awaits_bakeoff_validation`.\n\nCanonical plan: `~/puluf-plan.md`."  # 4489
